12. NEUTRAL EARTHING TRANSFORMER 10BAB11 (SIE 2.3 + SLD)
==============================================================================
  primary 12701.71 V (= 22 kV/sqrt3), secondary 500 V -> turns ratio = 25.4034 (SIE states 25.4)
  loading resistor R1 = 2.62 ohm on the 500 V side
  referred to the 22 kV/sqrt3 primary: R = R1*TRU^2 = 1690.77 ohm
  resulting earth-fault current if the full phase voltage appears across it:
     I = (22000/sqrt3)/1690.77 = 7.51 A
  SIE also states R_HV-DC = 60 ohm ; APS form answered Zn = "(60) Low-Reactance".
  NET rating 135 kVA / 20 s appears on BOTH SIE 2.3 and the INEL SLD.
  => generator neutral is HIGH-RESISTANCE earthed. NOT solidly earthed.

