13. SUMMARY OF EXECUTED CHECKS
==============================================================================
  All numbers above were produced by execution, not by hand.
  Checks that CLOSE exactly  : loss-table closures (GSUT/UAT/GAT), Sk" from Ik",
                               nameplate current, P/Q at rated pf, SCR<->1/Xd(sat).
  Checks that CLOSE approx.  : R from losses vs datasheet R (1.2 % / 10 % / 7 %),
                               copper scaling (2.3 % / 3.0 %), Ta via temperature.
  Checks that DO NOT close   : none that are claimed as validations.
  Physics-based rejection    : GSUT I0 = 0.00034 % (negative radicand).

